# 代码所有者 / Code owners
#
# 这些路径的改动会自动请求对应审阅者。
# 本文件必须位于 .github/、仓库根或 docs/ 之一。
#
# Paths below get automatic review requests. This file must live in .github/,
# the repository root, or docs/.
#
# 注意：占位符 @OWNER 需替换为真实账号或团队，否则 GitHub 会直接报错。
# NOTE: replace the @OWNER placeholder with a real account or team, or GitHub
# will reject the file.

# 默认：整个仓库归维护者 / Default: whole repository
*                       @OWNER

# 基座：设计律所在，改动需要最严格审查
# The base: the design law lives here; changes need the strictest review
/base/                  @OWNER
/docs/design.md         @OWNER
/docs/design.en.md      @OWNER
/docs/conformance.md    @OWNER
/docs/conformance.en.md @OWNER

# 安全与评估结论 / Security and assessment claims
/SECURITY.md            @OWNER
/docs/assessment.md     @OWNER
/docs/assessment.en.md  @OWNER

# 构建与 CI / Build and CI
/Makefile               @OWNER
/.github/workflows/     @OWNER
/tools/                 @OWNER

# 架构层：各架构可指定不同负责人
# Architecture layer: each architecture may have its own owner
/arch/x86_64/           @OWNER
/arch/riscv64/          @OWNER
